+  // GORILLA D-157-36 (2026-10-08): a captured profile is never handed to a site on the network. Upstream opens
+  // profiler.firefox.com (Mozilla's hosted viewer, which then offers an upload to its storage) with the profile:
+  // open tabs, addresses, timings. Only a viewer running on this machine is accepted (set
+  // devtools.performance.recording.ui-base-url to it, e.g. http://localhost:4242); anything else is refused.
+  let host = "";
